Register gpt-6.2-sol and gpt-6.2-astra with the metadata of their siblings
(GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6 Astra; Astra at its own list price); upstream lists the
same modalities, limits and reasoning efforts. Without them the adapter treats
GPT-6.2 as a non-reasoning model: it keeps sampling parameters and drops the
encrypted reasoning include and the requested effort. Remove when upstream
lists GPT-6.2.

